# closed operations are never withheld: with every mechanism on, an operation of whose operands nothing is known or guessed has the very form that it has with all of them withheld
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: mechanisms all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: b0([[o]]: {{*}}@JSValue {{*}}, [[n]]: {{*}}@JSValue {{*}})
# CHECK: [[x]]: {{*}}@JSValue = PropGet [[o]] key="x"
# CHECK: @JSValue = Add [[x]], [[n]] form=Generic
# RUN(NOTHING): walk f1 mechanisms=all
# NOTHING-NOT: TypeTest
# NOTHING-NOT: ShapeTest
# NOTHING-NOT: GetSlot
# PROGRAM-OF: every-operation-is-copied.ir
